    {
      "claim": "Direct human absolute bioavailability of acamprosate is approximately 11% (C04, C06, C14, C16, C17, C21, C25, C39, C87), and L4/L5 Caco-2 records show acamprosate Papp approximately 1.5×10^-7 cm/s with no significant A-B/B-A asymmetry (C195, C201, C217, C232, C235, C237, C242); the query is larger and more polar, so this low-F outcome transfers. A single report of 42% (C28) is outweighed by multiple absolute F ~11% measurements.",
